  "solution": "**Logic :** (Cube of 1st number + 1st number) = 2nd number\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 4 : 70\n\n(4)³ + 4 = 70\n\n**64 + 4**__ = 70\n\n**68 ≠ 70 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 3 : 30​\n\n(3)³ + 3 = 30 \n\n**27 + 3**__ = 30\n\n30 = 30 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 6 : 222 \n\n(6)³ + 6 = 222\n\n**216 + 6**__ = 222\n\n222 = 222 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 7 : 350\n\n(7)³ + 7 = 350\n\n**343 + 7**__ = 350\n\n350 = 350 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, **\"Option - (1)\" **is the correct answer.",
